WEBVTT

00:11.968 --> 00:18.016
♪Listen to the cicadas in the midsummer♪

00:18.944 --> 00:21.653
♪The reflection in your eyes♪

00:22.498 --> 00:27.040
♪A brilliant scenery♪

00:27.744 --> 00:33.518
♪Moonlight spills over
the endless clear sky♪

00:34.349 --> 00:42.496
♪The roar of the heartbeat
leaves a trace behind♪

00:44.032 --> 00:49.566
♪Crush, when night meets dawn♪

00:51.616 --> 00:57.786
♪Crush, rushing to you in the crowd♪

00:59.520 --> 01:02.624
♪Baby, fall in my heart♪

01:03.040 --> 01:07.085
♪Fervent, boiling love♪

01:07.776 --> 01:11.760
♪How you long for the future♪

01:12.128 --> 01:15.328
♪Charging recklessly, getting hurt♪

01:15.520 --> 01:18.475
♪Fall in my heart♪

01:18.475 --> 01:22.816
♪If tears fill your eyes♪

01:23.328 --> 01:27.297
♪Let the damp wind stay in memories♪

01:27.566 --> 01:33.940
♪We stand by each other among the crowd♪

01:33.940 --> 01:39.040
=Be Passionately in Love=

01:40.952 --> 01:42.840
=Episode 20=
(I am Xu Zhi's Boyfriend)

01:49.600 --> 01:50.600
Senior.

01:52.681 --> 01:53.841
I brought another batch over.

01:53.841 --> 01:54.560
Take a look.

01:54.801 --> 01:55.841
You can pick one.

01:56.120 --> 01:57.120
How about this one?

01:58.401 --> 01:59.401
And this one.

01:59.721 --> 02:00.721
I think it's nice.

02:00.960 --> 02:01.960
Okay?

02:04.080 --> 02:05.480
Just get a corner for me.

02:06.080 --> 02:07.080
Come on.

02:07.681 --> 02:08.960
You've come many times.

02:09.560 --> 02:10.921
I've told you,

02:12.201 --> 02:13.600
you can't even get into

02:13.600 --> 02:14.761
the freshman art exhibition.

02:14.881 --> 02:16.160
Stop dreaming.

02:16.560 --> 02:17.881
Even if you beg me more,

02:18.000 --> 02:19.000
it's useless.

02:20.040 --> 02:21.040
Senior.

02:22.440 --> 02:23.440
Help me out.

02:23.640 --> 02:24.801
If the booth doesn't work,

02:25.401 --> 02:26.721
can you get any open space

02:27.040 --> 02:28.041
for me?

02:28.041 --> 02:29.201
I can place it on the ground.

02:29.440 --> 02:29.960
Okay?

02:30.401 --> 02:32.000
Do you force me to tell you the truth?

02:32.640 --> 02:35.000
I know the capabilities
of you freshmen well.

02:35.801 --> 02:37.921
People like you who haven't much talent

02:38.241 --> 02:40.841
are recruited
to boost others' confidence.

02:41.321 --> 02:42.321
Here's my advice to you.

02:42.560 --> 02:44.281
Instead of wasting time on painting,

02:44.841 --> 02:46.560
you might as well be a fitness coach.

03:03.960 --> 03:04.960
Zhu Yangqi.

03:05.241 --> 03:06.560
Zhu Yangqi.

03:08.841 --> 03:10.321
You didn't get in the exhibition,

03:10.761 --> 03:11.960
so you feel ashamed?

03:12.921 --> 03:13.922
At least you got into

03:13.922 --> 03:14.960
a first-tier university.

03:15.201 --> 03:15.761
What about me?

03:16.160 --> 03:17.201
I'm repeating a year.

03:18.000 --> 03:19.520
It's uncertain if I can get in.

03:20.281 --> 03:21.520
Compared to you,

03:21.520 --> 03:22.960
I should feel more ashamed.

03:23.681 --> 03:24.881
I never said that.

03:29.080 --> 03:30.080
Come on.

03:30.160 --> 03:30.600
What for?

03:30.841 --> 03:31.841
Come over.

03:32.160 --> 03:33.160
Sit down.

03:44.560 --> 03:45.560
I'll play you a song.

03:55.064 --> 03:58.959
♪We are not afraid of
the complicated world♪

03:59.192 --> 04:02.576
♪Only passionate love
like a ray of sunshine♪

04:02.968 --> 04:04.960
♪Can beat the night♪

04:04.960 --> 04:06.921
This is my favorite song recently.

04:10.321 --> 04:12.560
During my art exam studies in Qingyi,

04:12.841 --> 04:14.600
I always felt like I can do better.

04:15.681 --> 04:17.201
After coming to Beijing, I realize

04:17.321 --> 04:18.440
the gap between people

04:18.440 --> 04:19.801
is really huge.

04:21.960 --> 04:23.921
I can't distinguish
between front and back nasals,

04:24.241 --> 04:26.560
while others are reciting
tongue twisters at triple speed.

04:27.440 --> 04:28.841
But so what?

04:29.440 --> 04:31.520
99 percent of people in this world

04:31.520 --> 04:32.801
are here to be the participants.

04:33.401 --> 04:34.322
But it doesn't prevent

04:34.322 --> 04:35.881
us, the ordinary ones,

04:36.160 --> 04:36.961
from working hard

04:36.961 --> 04:38.440
to chase our dreams.

04:40.080 --> 04:41.560
Don't compare with others,

04:42.321 --> 04:43.881
but who you were yesterday.

04:47.480 --> 04:48.480
Zhu Yangqi,

04:49.040 --> 04:50.921
if one day I look down on you,

04:51.801 --> 04:54.600
it must be
because you gave up on yourself.

04:54.712 --> 04:56.312
♪Can beat the night♪

04:56.312 --> 04:58.361
♪We can outrun time♪

04:58.361 --> 04:59.361
Want to make a bet?

04:59.520 --> 05:00.761
This day next year,

05:01.401 --> 05:02.881
I will attend a Beijing university.

05:03.440 --> 05:04.440
And you

05:05.120 --> 05:06.841
will hold a school exhibition.

05:10.640 --> 05:11.640
Do it or not?

05:14.040 --> 05:15.040
Yes.

05:16.792 --> 05:20.724
♪We'll turn our backs
on youth together and take risks♪

05:20.920 --> 05:22.841
♪Let all the sadness and joy♪

05:22.841 --> 05:23.841
It sounds quite nice.

05:24.728 --> 05:29.037
♪All blend into our season♪

05:40.000 --> 05:41.440
(Film Forum)
(Who doesn't tear up)

05:41.440 --> 05:42.440
(watching Hachiko?)

05:48.640 --> 05:50.201
(How ruthless are they?)

05:51.281 --> 05:52.841
(Maybe they have emotional disorders.)

05:54.640 --> 05:57.000
(Oh my, so cold-blooded.)

05:59.080 --> 06:01.640
(Being in relationship
with someone like this is terrifying.)

06:02.681 --> 06:04.560
(Shy Boy Chen)
(Crying is just a surface issue.)

06:05.160 --> 06:07.761
(It's because your emotions
have always been suppressed.)

06:08.160 --> 06:09.721
(When you encounter something upset,)

06:09.881 --> 06:12.080
(try to let your emotions out.)

06:12.281 --> 06:14.480
(Then you may find your spirit back.)

06:17.080 --> 06:19.640
(Got it. Thank you, Professor Chen.)

06:40.761 --> 06:42.080
Still couldn't cry?

06:43.321 --> 06:44.640
Don't force yourself.

06:45.960 --> 06:47.000
I told you

06:47.761 --> 06:49.600
that you are not suited
to be an architect.

06:50.401 --> 06:51.721
Why do you say that?

06:52.640 --> 06:53.681
When you were young,

06:54.440 --> 06:56.401
you couldn't even draw an egg properly.

06:57.960 --> 06:59.361
You smashed the model I gave you

06:59.841 --> 07:01.361
to pieces at the time.

07:03.321 --> 07:04.761
You said

07:05.120 --> 07:06.960
that the thing you hate most is houses.

07:07.201 --> 07:08.361
I said that out of anger.

07:08.560 --> 07:09.761
You stood me up at that time.

07:10.440 --> 07:12.361
So you broke the gift

07:12.361 --> 07:13.361
I gave to you?

07:18.600 --> 07:19.841
This is how you are.

07:21.681 --> 07:23.560
You never consider my feelings.

07:28.361 --> 07:29.960
Do you think I want to be your daughter?

07:30.520 --> 07:32.600
You made me give up
studying architecture.

07:32.761 --> 07:33.682
Do you know how much

07:33.682 --> 07:35.401
effort I've put in
to get where I am today?

07:36.361 --> 07:37.841
You just left,

07:38.480 --> 07:40.201
leaving me, Dad, and Grandma behind.

07:40.841 --> 07:42.600
Have you ever considered us?

07:42.801 --> 07:43.641
Since I was a kid,

07:43.641 --> 07:45.681
I've never received your praise.

07:48.361 --> 07:50.160
You were never satisfied with me.

07:50.560 --> 07:51.721
Everything I do is wrong.

07:51.721 --> 07:53.480
So what do you want from me?

07:55.120 --> 07:57.080
Want me to die like you?

08:09.801 --> 08:10.801
Come out.

08:14.801 --> 08:15.960
Come out.

09:31.601 --> 09:32.601
Morning.

09:33.561 --> 09:34.721
Here's your egg burger

09:35.120 --> 09:37.320
and triple concentrated hot Americano.

09:38.881 --> 09:39.881
Thank you.

09:42.000 --> 09:43.320
A bug on your head.

09:44.681 --> 09:45.881
It's a sleepy bug.

09:46.320 --> 09:47.160
Really?

09:47.160 --> 09:47.882
So sleepy?

09:47.882 --> 09:50.000
I've already put my sleepy bug away.

09:51.000 --> 09:52.000
Didn't you sleep well?

09:52.521 --> 09:53.521
No.

09:54.160 --> 09:56.200
I dreamt of my mom again

09:56.641 --> 09:57.921
and quarreled with her,

09:58.240 --> 09:59.721
saying a lot of harsh words.

10:03.040 --> 10:03.521
Listen.

10:03.801 --> 10:05.320
Show me a photo of your mom,

10:06.521 --> 10:08.280
I can try to dream of her.

10:08.280 --> 10:09.801
And then beg her in the dream

10:09.801 --> 10:11.080
to stop quarrelling with you.

10:14.160 --> 10:15.400
You brat!

10:15.400 --> 10:17.320
No one would do that.

10:18.120 --> 10:19.121
But I can show you

10:19.121 --> 10:20.240
how cool my mom was.

10:23.681 --> 10:25.400
My mom participated in

10:26.280 --> 10:28.561
a heritage building restoration project
in Europe.

10:29.160 --> 10:31.521
She was the only Chinese girl
on the team.

10:32.561 --> 10:34.000
She liked this photo so much,

10:34.000 --> 10:35.481
and used it as her profile picture.

10:38.000 --> 10:39.000
Cool.

10:39.481 --> 10:40.481
Just like you.

10:44.200 --> 10:45.521
I really miss her.

10:48.400 --> 10:50.841
We have many misunderstandings
that were not resolved.

10:51.200 --> 10:52.521
My dad said she left me a letter

10:52.521 --> 10:53.921
before she died.

10:54.801 --> 10:56.761
But that letter was accidentally

10:56.761 --> 10:58.561
burned with my mom's clothes
by my grandma.

10:59.921 --> 11:02.561
I really want to know
what was written in that letter,

11:03.320 --> 11:05.160
but I might never know.

11:23.000 --> 11:25.120
(Ying)
Zhi, are you available this weekend?

11:25.400 --> 11:26.801
I'll take the exam next month,

11:26.801 --> 11:27.881
wanting to go pray.

11:28.080 --> 11:29.080
Want to come along?

11:29.681 --> 11:30.681
Let's go together.

11:31.561 --> 11:32.681
I want to pray too.

11:35.240 --> 11:36.240
Okay.

11:37.240 --> 11:38.921
As long as
it's not the Fertility Goddess.

11:41.601 --> 11:42.601
Cheers.

11:42.881 --> 11:44.280
Eat up, or it'll get cold.

11:47.544 --> 11:49.080
(Blessing tree)

12:05.000 --> 12:06.841
What wish are you making?
You are so sincere.

12:07.681 --> 12:09.441
Zhi, you're here.

12:09.801 --> 12:11.120
Did you see

12:11.120 --> 12:12.441
the shop selling wishing plaques?

12:12.561 --> 12:13.761
Look, here.

12:14.200 --> 12:14.841
Everyone,

12:15.040 --> 12:16.521
do you want to buy wishing plaques?

12:18.040 --> 12:19.001
Go straight over there,

12:19.001 --> 12:20.881
and the shop is at the corner.

12:21.721 --> 12:22.641
Then let's go buy some.

12:22.721 --> 12:23.120
Okay.

12:23.120 --> 12:23.601
Alright.

12:23.801 --> 12:25.521
You go ahead. I'll look around.

12:25.641 --> 12:26.801
I'll buy one for you.

12:26.881 --> 12:27.360
Okay.

12:27.481 --> 12:28.960
Alright. Let's go.

12:29.400 --> 12:30.400
Okay.

12:49.400 --> 12:50.400
Hello.

12:51.000 --> 12:53.120
We only accept wishing plaques here.
No letters.

12:53.921 --> 12:54.921
Really?

12:55.761 --> 12:56.761
Sorry.

13:09.801 --> 13:11.320
What did that person just tell you?

13:12.841 --> 13:13.841
He said I have a talent,

13:14.120 --> 13:15.721
asked if I wanted to sever worldly ties.

13:16.561 --> 13:17.761
What did you tell him?

13:18.000 --> 13:19.160
My minds are a jumble

13:19.481 --> 13:20.601
and I'm too obsessed.

13:21.040 --> 13:22.160
Just an ordinary person.

13:27.921 --> 13:29.801
Let's go buy wishing plaques.

13:30.160 --> 13:31.681
I thought you didn't go.

13:33.080 --> 13:34.240
You didn't want to buy it.

13:34.240 --> 13:35.881
Now you do?

13:39.561 --> 13:41.841
We have made our wishes,

13:41.841 --> 13:42.762
and hung the plaques.

13:42.762 --> 13:44.000
It should work, right?

13:44.200 --> 13:45.320
Definitely.

13:45.320 --> 13:46.320
Trust me.

13:46.481 --> 13:48.160
Next year,
I will wait for you in Beijing.

13:48.160 --> 13:49.160
Okay.

13:53.320 --> 13:55.400
I have to go back to finish my work.

13:55.601 --> 13:56.320
I'll pay the bill.

13:56.320 --> 13:57.320
I'll do it.

13:57.681 --> 13:58.761
No, sit down.

13:58.761 --> 13:59.160
Let's go.

13:59.160 --> 14:00.160
You sit.

14:00.360 --> 14:01.921
Okay. You do it.

14:02.641 --> 14:03.641
Caught a cold?

14:05.080 --> 14:06.080
Wear my jacket.

14:06.960 --> 14:07.960
It's colder outside.

14:10.280 --> 14:11.280
Let's go.

14:40.984 --> 14:41.912
(Ms. Lin Qiudie.)

15:00.801 --> 15:01.801
(Aunt Lin,)

15:01.960 --> 15:02.960
(hello.)

15:03.240 --> 15:04.240
(My name is Chen Luzhou.)

15:04.641 --> 15:06.040
(I am Xu Zhi's boyfriend.)

15:07.200 --> 15:09.320
(Xu Zhi said she quarreled
with you in a dream.)

15:09.801 --> 15:10.841
(I am a bit worried,)

15:11.601 --> 15:13.721
(so I took the liberty
to write you this letter.)

15:14.561 --> 15:15.841
(I hope this won't bother you.)

15:17.601 --> 15:19.360
(During the time I have been with her,)

15:19.641 --> 15:21.841
(she has mentioned you several times.)

15:22.960 --> 15:24.921
(I can tell from her words)

15:25.240 --> 15:27.280
(that she has admired you greatly
since childhood.)

15:27.761 --> 15:29.200
(Your death was a huge blow to her.)

15:30.960 --> 15:32.481
(She has always wanted your approval.)

15:33.681 --> 15:35.481
(Perhaps her grades
weren't good before,)

15:36.200 --> 15:37.360
(but you might not know)

15:37.521 --> 15:39.441
(she scored 738
in College Entrance Examination)

15:39.721 --> 15:42.000
(and got into Huaguang University
as the first place.)

15:42.200 --> 15:44.240
(She is now a student
of School of Architecture.)

15:44.240 --> 15:45.521
(Her grades are excellent.)

15:47.240 --> 15:49.801
(I wrote this letter only to tell you)

15:50.801 --> 15:52.200
(that Xu Zhi is excellent)

15:52.721 --> 15:53.721
(and loves you so much.)

15:53.921 --> 15:55.841
(Just like you loved her.)

15:57.561 --> 15:58.960
(You had been strict to her.)

15:59.561 --> 16:00.681
(She loved playing water.)

16:01.200 --> 16:02.841
(When she almost flooded
the living room,)

16:03.240 --> 16:04.441
(she got a scolding from you)

16:04.881 --> 16:06.601
(and lost her pocket money for a month.)

16:07.120 --> 16:09.240
(I can tell you were very angry.)

16:09.801 --> 16:11.400
(But your most proud work)

16:11.561 --> 16:13.000
(was built on water.)

16:14.561 --> 16:16.441
(Perhaps when you
drew the design drafts,)

16:16.761 --> 16:18.681
(you were thinking of your daughter.)

16:21.000 --> 16:22.441
(I want to ask you for a favor.)

16:24.000 --> 16:26.080
(If she dreams of you again next time,)

16:26.881 --> 16:28.000
(could you praise her)

16:29.280 --> 16:30.921
(and say you love her?)

17:18.456 --> 17:24.186
♪Listen to the cicadas in the midsummer♪

17:25.432 --> 17:28.362
♪The reflection in your eyes♪

17:29.304 --> 17:32.120
♪A brilliant scenery♪

17:32.120 --> 17:33.120
Chen Luzhou.

17:34.104 --> 17:38.561
♪Moonlight spills over
the endless clear sky♪

17:38.561 --> 17:39.561
What's wrong?

17:40.888 --> 17:44.320
♪The roar of the heartbeat♪

17:44.320 --> 17:45.320
What's wrong?

17:45.400 --> 17:49.930
♪Drew a trajectory♪

17:50.616 --> 17:52.921
♪Crush, when night meets dawn♪

17:52.921 --> 17:54.360
Thank you for your letter.

17:59.681 --> 18:01.080
I didn't think you'd read it.

18:03.881 --> 18:05.441
But I read it.

18:08.088 --> 18:11.831
♪Baby, fall in my heart♪

18:11.831 --> 18:15.503
♪Fervent, boiling love♪

18:16.248 --> 18:20.568
♪How you long for the future♪

18:20.728 --> 18:23.992
♪Charging recklessly, getting hurt♪

18:23.992 --> 18:27.034
♪Fall in my heart♪

18:27.034 --> 18:31.059
♪If tears fill your eyes♪

18:31.768 --> 18:36.312
♪Let the damp wind stay in memories♪

18:36.312 --> 18:42.524
♪We stand by each other among the crowd♪

18:51.160 --> 18:53.320
Actually,
there is something I didn't tell you.

18:53.960 --> 18:54.960
What is it?

18:56.080 --> 18:58.641
I met your dad before coming to Beijing.

19:23.481 --> 19:24.481
Young man.

19:24.881 --> 19:25.881
Want pan-fried buns?

19:28.481 --> 19:29.040
Just a moment.

19:29.200 --> 19:29.881
One portion.

19:30.200 --> 19:31.200
Okay.

19:57.120 --> 19:58.521
You won't

19:59.320 --> 20:00.521
go abroad again, right?

20:02.641 --> 20:03.641
Then you

20:04.320 --> 20:05.320
and

20:05.561 --> 20:06.561
Zhi...

20:07.120 --> 20:08.120
I haven't contacted her.

20:09.240 --> 20:10.681
H-Haven't contacted?

20:13.000 --> 20:15.080
After returning,
I have things to handle.

20:19.200 --> 20:21.801
I'm not forbidding you two from dating,

20:22.400 --> 20:23.400
but

20:24.921 --> 20:27.120
she's my daughter.

20:29.561 --> 20:33.000
I'm afraid she'll be deceived

20:33.681 --> 20:35.521
or get hurt.

20:38.881 --> 20:40.681
It's not that I don't trust you.

20:42.320 --> 20:44.761
We are both men.

20:45.761 --> 20:46.841
You know

20:50.400 --> 20:52.601
men are no good.

21:01.841 --> 21:04.200
My dad has never said these to me.

21:04.921 --> 21:06.360
I guess so.

21:07.561 --> 21:10.120
I planned to tell him about us

21:10.120 --> 21:11.481
during the winter vacation.

21:11.881 --> 21:12.881
Don't.

21:13.441 --> 21:14.721
I think he's quite afraid of me.

21:14.921 --> 21:16.080
For what?

21:16.841 --> 21:18.360
Afraid I'll take his daughter away.

21:21.080 --> 21:22.561
I didn't understand him before.

21:23.320 --> 21:24.161
As a grown man,

21:24.161 --> 21:25.681
why is he so dependent on you?

21:26.601 --> 21:28.881
But after you told me about your mom,

21:29.000 --> 21:31.360
I feel like he only has you now.

21:48.120 --> 21:49.208
(Zhi)

22:03.512 --> 22:05.368
(Zhi)

22:14.841 --> 22:16.000
Hey, Dad.

22:16.200 --> 22:17.200
Hello?

22:17.521 --> 22:19.481
Are you Dr. Xu's daughter?

22:20.120 --> 22:21.521
You are...

22:22.240 --> 22:24.080
I am his caregiver.

22:24.280 --> 22:25.320
He has gone downstairs.

22:25.521 --> 22:28.040
I thought you might have
an urgent matter, so I answered.

22:28.641 --> 22:29.921
You're the caregiver.

22:30.320 --> 22:31.400
What's wrong with my dad?

22:31.400 --> 22:32.481
Is he not feeling well?

22:33.320 --> 22:34.320
Not at all.

22:35.040 --> 22:36.280
It's nothing major.

22:36.481 --> 22:39.120
Today, someone made a scene
at the hospital,

22:39.320 --> 22:40.721
and something happened.

22:40.841 --> 22:42.960
Your dad has a slight concussion.

22:42.960 --> 22:43.960
Nothing serious.

22:44.160 --> 22:46.521
Mr. Cai asked him
to be admitted for observation.

22:47.040 --> 22:48.400
Was he attacked?

22:48.841 --> 22:49.521
No.

22:49.761 --> 22:51.200
He was trying to break up a fight.

22:51.441 --> 22:53.721
The floor was slippery
after being mopped,

22:53.881 --> 22:55.080
and he was in a hurry,

22:55.280 --> 22:57.120
so slipped right after stepping out.

22:57.481 --> 22:58.801
Is he okay?

22:59.080 --> 23:00.280
He's fine. Don't worry.

23:00.481 --> 23:01.000
By the way,

23:01.240 --> 23:02.881
Mr. Cai gave him

23:02.881 --> 23:04.080
an award for bravery.

23:04.200 --> 23:05.601
He went to receive the award.

23:06.240 --> 23:07.240
Okay.

23:07.360 --> 23:08.641
It's good that he's fine.

23:09.521 --> 23:10.801
I'm giving you a big award.

23:11.960 --> 23:12.561
(Award for Attempting Bravely)

23:12.561 --> 23:14.320
How do you feel? Happy?

23:16.320 --> 23:18.080
Do you think I can be happy?

23:20.120 --> 23:21.120
Explain it.

23:21.441 --> 23:22.481
It is easy to understand.

23:22.561 --> 23:25.160
Award for Attempting Bravely.

23:26.280 --> 23:27.921
I was attempting bravely.

23:28.280 --> 23:30.601
But you can't say so here.

23:30.721 --> 23:32.120
Where's my prize?

23:32.641 --> 23:33.400
By the hospital.

23:33.400 --> 23:34.681
I've given you the award.

23:34.960 --> 23:36.080
No prize.

23:36.160 --> 23:37.200
I'll give you a fried bun.

23:37.400 --> 23:39.000
How can you be so stingy?

23:39.000 --> 23:40.441
For the hospital, I even

23:40.441 --> 23:42.160
got a concussion. Feel it.

23:42.160 --> 23:42.682
Back here.

23:42.682 --> 23:44.080
There's even a bump.

23:44.080 --> 23:44.761
See?

23:44.921 --> 23:45.442
Feel it.

23:45.442 --> 23:46.801
Let Ms. Wei feel it.

23:47.601 --> 23:48.601
That won't do.

23:48.801 --> 23:50.120
No prize, then...

23:50.120 --> 23:50.841
Medical expenses.

23:50.841 --> 23:51.521
No reimbursement.

23:51.681 --> 23:52.521
What?

23:52.641 --> 23:54.160
Then, sorry.

23:54.160 --> 23:55.960
I can't take this.

23:55.960 --> 23:58.160
This insults my dignity.

23:59.801 --> 24:00.841
Okay.

24:01.400 --> 24:03.200
I'll reimburse you myself.

24:03.200 --> 24:04.441
Alright, come on.

24:04.641 --> 24:05.681
You will reimburse me.

24:05.681 --> 24:06.442
Be good. Take it.

24:06.442 --> 24:07.641
I'll just hold onto this,

24:07.641 --> 24:08.641
for you.

24:10.000 --> 24:11.000
Alright.

24:11.441 --> 24:12.001
Tell me.

24:12.001 --> 24:13.921
Have you told

24:13.921 --> 24:15.080
your daughter

24:15.441 --> 24:16.681
about your act of bravery?

24:17.000 --> 24:18.601
What for? No.

24:18.761 --> 24:19.160
Wait.

24:19.761 --> 24:21.681
Aren't you now on good terms

24:21.681 --> 24:23.601
with Ms. Wei?

24:23.921 --> 24:25.521
You should tell your daughter about it.

24:25.801 --> 24:27.681
She is studying out of town now.

24:27.921 --> 24:29.481
She will come back

24:29.481 --> 24:30.481
during holidays.

24:30.881 --> 24:32.641
Hiding this from her is not okay.

24:33.320 --> 24:35.761
Your daughter is at a sensitive age now.

24:35.761 --> 24:36.921
What if

24:36.921 --> 24:37.921
she disagrees?

24:38.080 --> 24:39.080
So,

24:39.521 --> 24:41.521
she doesn't come back much.

24:41.521 --> 24:42.481
I just want to delay

24:42.481 --> 24:43.360
a bit.

24:43.360 --> 24:44.080
Besides,

24:44.280 --> 24:46.200
she just started college.

24:46.200 --> 24:49.120
I'll wait till she graduates
to bring it up.

24:52.080 --> 24:55.360
You look a little embarrassed.

24:55.561 --> 24:56.241
What?

24:56.241 --> 24:57.641
Feeling embarrassed

24:57.641 --> 24:59.240
towards your girl or Ms. Wei?

25:00.481 --> 25:02.601
Well, it's hard to handle it.

25:03.160 --> 25:04.721
It's okay. I understand you.

25:04.721 --> 25:06.200
I understand you.

25:06.801 --> 25:07.801
Are you okay?

25:08.761 --> 25:09.921
I'm so mad.

25:10.561 --> 25:11.601
Take a look.

25:11.841 --> 25:12.200
Look.

25:12.761 --> 25:14.601
What he gave me.

25:14.601 --> 25:15.681
Well.

25:15.681 --> 25:18.000
Award for Attempting Bravely.

25:18.481 --> 25:20.080
I was so helpless. He...

25:20.601 --> 25:22.200
He's just teasing me.

25:23.160 --> 25:24.521
What kind of award is this?

25:24.881 --> 25:25.882
Maybe many people

25:25.882 --> 25:27.240
are laughing at me.

25:29.320 --> 25:30.960
Do you think I'm useless?

25:31.481 --> 25:32.801
No way.

25:33.721 --> 25:35.761
That troublemaker was holding a knife,

25:35.761 --> 25:36.841
standing in front of me.

25:37.360 --> 25:38.801
So many people in the hospital,

25:39.040 --> 25:40.681
only you stood out

25:41.120 --> 25:42.441
to solve the problem.

25:42.561 --> 25:43.801
You are a hero.

25:45.040 --> 25:46.280
- This Mr. Cai.
- I've risked it.

25:47.080 --> 25:48.120
I'll go argue with him.

25:48.120 --> 25:49.120
Don't.

25:49.441 --> 25:51.080
I've got some compensation from him.

25:53.481 --> 25:54.481
By the way,

25:55.360 --> 25:56.761
your daughter called.

25:58.481 --> 25:59.881
She sounded quite anxious.

25:59.881 --> 26:00.721
Did you answer that?

26:00.721 --> 26:01.721
Yes.

26:02.000 --> 26:03.000
But rest assured.

26:03.240 --> 26:05.601
I told her I'm your caregiver.

26:07.441 --> 26:08.441
Sorry.

26:09.080 --> 26:10.080
For me,

26:10.761 --> 26:11.921
you even had to lie.

26:12.801 --> 26:13.801
Not at all.

26:14.360 --> 26:16.481
I know about your family's situation.

26:17.441 --> 26:20.441
Xu Zhi is a very sensible
and well-behaved child.

26:21.641 --> 26:23.360
And my son has just entered high school.

26:24.080 --> 26:26.441
I hadn't thought about
reorganizing the family so soon.

26:30.441 --> 26:33.120
We're taking care of each other now.

26:33.641 --> 26:35.601
I have someone
to care about in my heart.

26:36.040 --> 26:37.320
I'm pretty content.

26:38.000 --> 26:39.001
Wait until the children

26:39.001 --> 26:41.040
get a stable job and life.

26:41.521 --> 26:43.481
It's time for us to discuss our future.

26:44.761 --> 26:45.761
Alright.

26:48.080 --> 26:49.080
As you wish.

26:57.921 --> 26:59.400
(Finished the call with my dad.)

27:06.441 --> 27:07.761
(Shy Boy Chen)
(Raining cats and dogs,)

27:09.040 --> 27:10.921
(she said she would always love me.)

27:17.641 --> 27:18.641
The data report you want

27:19.400 --> 27:20.441
has just been printed out.

27:20.441 --> 27:21.601
Calculate again to see

27:21.601 --> 27:22.200
if it's right.

27:22.200 --> 27:23.200
Okay.

27:30.584 --> 27:32.248
(Rain cats and dogs)
(Finished the call with my dad.)

27:40.881 --> 27:42.080
(Shy Boy Chen)
(How is Mr. Xu?)

27:42.761 --> 27:44.960
(He is hospitalized,
but nothing serious.)

27:44.960 --> 27:46.601
(He fell because of the slippery floor.)

27:46.601 --> 27:47.960
(Got a mild concussion.)

27:51.160 --> 27:53.521
(Go back early to keep him company.)

27:55.000 --> 27:57.120
(What does the saying
in your profile mean?)

28:08.040 --> 28:10.040
(I think you've already forgotten
what you said)

28:10.040 --> 28:11.040
(before.)

28:14.521 --> 28:16.801
(I hope in your days without me,)

28:17.040 --> 28:19.320
(your world will still shine brightly,)

28:20.320 --> 28:23.000
(teeming with flowers and applause.)

28:23.641 --> 28:25.601
(As long as it still rains in Qingyi)

28:25.841 --> 28:27.481
(and the puppy wags its tail,)

28:28.441 --> 28:30.721
(someone will always love you.)

28:49.240 --> 28:51.200
Chen Luzhou, come over and take a look.

28:53.841 --> 28:54.360
(Stop here.)

28:54.641 --> 28:56.280
(Li Ke is asking me
to finish the report.)

28:56.801 --> 28:58.160
(You go to bed first. Good night.)

29:02.080 --> 29:03.641
You are staying up so late

29:03.641 --> 29:04.641
to work with me,

29:05.000 --> 29:06.000
not chatting with Zhi.

29:06.160 --> 29:08.040
If she knows, she won't be angry, right?

29:09.240 --> 29:10.240
Get lost.

29:13.441 --> 29:14.441
By the way,

29:14.601 --> 29:16.641
Zhang Yu asked me
to have a meal few days ago.

29:16.641 --> 29:18.761
She asked me if you had time.

29:19.040 --> 29:20.200
I told her you went

29:20.200 --> 29:21.200
to date your girlfriend.

29:21.441 --> 29:22.441
She asked me that,

29:22.601 --> 29:23.601
and I said another day.

29:25.481 --> 29:27.561
I remember that you two
had a good relationship.

29:27.561 --> 29:28.841
But now you don't seem close.

29:29.641 --> 29:30.360
Let me tell you.

29:30.601 --> 29:32.040
We've discussed privately

29:32.681 --> 29:34.360
that she probably likes you.

29:38.681 --> 29:39.681
What do you mean?

29:40.441 --> 29:41.441
Feeling regretful?

29:42.601 --> 29:43.681
Are you an idiot?

29:45.080 --> 29:46.080
We were desk mates,

29:46.721 --> 29:47.960
and interactions are needed.

29:48.360 --> 29:49.601
But she doesn't like me.

29:49.921 --> 29:50.921
Are you sure?

29:51.400 --> 29:53.000
She often mentions you to me.

29:53.000 --> 29:54.000
Now we're in college.

29:54.160 --> 29:55.521
She still wants me to invite you.

29:55.761 --> 29:57.400
Do you ever think of a possibility

29:57.601 --> 29:59.960
that she likes you?

30:00.160 --> 30:01.801
What? Me?

30:01.921 --> 30:03.120
How is that possible?

30:03.320 --> 30:04.801
If she liked me, I'd know.

30:05.960 --> 30:07.521
You were such a blockhead back then,

30:07.921 --> 30:09.521
only focused on studying.

30:09.960 --> 30:11.360
You felt annoyed on playing.

30:11.561 --> 30:13.320
How can you know she likes you?

30:17.040 --> 30:18.200
Think it through.

30:18.441 --> 30:20.000
During the final exams,

30:20.320 --> 30:20.922
why did you

30:20.922 --> 30:22.441
always have breakfast on your desk?

30:24.320 --> 30:26.000
D-Didn't you buy it for me?

30:27.160 --> 30:28.400
I'm nice to you,

30:28.641 --> 30:30.160
but not that nice.

30:31.400 --> 30:32.801
Zhang Yu brought you.

30:35.761 --> 30:36.761
Chen Luzhou.

30:37.960 --> 30:39.521
Don't be kidding.

30:39.681 --> 30:41.320
Don't mess with me.

30:41.881 --> 30:43.441
I am serious.

30:44.080 --> 30:45.080
It's the truth.

30:45.960 --> 30:47.441
Besides, you're a top student

30:47.801 --> 30:48.801
and very handsome.

30:49.320 --> 30:50.681
Have some confidence, okay?

30:56.921 --> 30:57.921
What's wrong?

30:58.481 --> 30:59.481
Feeling regretful?

31:01.200 --> 31:02.200
Get lost.

31:11.320 --> 31:12.320
Tell me once you've done.

31:21.320 --> 31:22.681
Hello, everyone.

31:22.921 --> 31:24.120
Mr. Wan is busy today,

31:24.280 --> 31:25.320
so I'll be substituting.

31:27.160 --> 31:29.801
Some of you might not know me.

31:30.441 --> 31:32.000
My name is Bai Jiang.

31:32.360 --> 31:34.360
After this class,

31:34.761 --> 31:36.240
I hope you all learn something.

31:36.561 --> 31:38.841
Don't let my teaching go to waste.

31:44.320 --> 31:45.320
That student,

31:46.000 --> 31:47.000
aren't you grouped?

31:47.801 --> 31:48.280
No.

31:48.481 --> 31:49.801
Sit in the second row.

31:52.881 --> 31:54.601
Did everyone get the teaching aids?

31:55.160 --> 31:56.801
- Yes.
- Yes.

31:57.641 --> 31:58.641
Today,

31:59.601 --> 32:02.881
let's set the textbooks aside.

32:04.000 --> 32:06.841
It's better to practice
than to only learn theory.

32:07.561 --> 32:08.561
Look.

32:08.641 --> 32:09.960
Today I will teach you

32:10.441 --> 32:13.360
about sandbox simulation management.

32:52.721 --> 32:54.441
Let me announce the results.

32:54.681 --> 32:56.200
We have a total of nine groups today.

32:56.801 --> 32:58.681
Only Group Two and Four
haven't gone bankrupt.

33:00.280 --> 33:01.801
Now, let's have the two group leaders

33:01.801 --> 33:02.881
introduce themselves.

33:05.120 --> 33:06.561
Zhang Qikai, Class 2, Metalworking.

33:08.441 --> 33:09.481
Group Four

33:09.881 --> 33:11.841
relied on industrial upgrading
to become bigger.

33:12.721 --> 33:15.721
It is unquestionably the first place.

33:15.721 --> 33:16.721
It is worth encouraging.

33:21.441 --> 33:22.441
Group Two.

33:24.841 --> 33:25.841
Sir,

33:26.561 --> 33:27.601
I'm not from your college.

33:27.681 --> 33:28.681
I'm here just to audit.

33:29.681 --> 33:30.280
Audit?

33:30.400 --> 33:30.881
Yes.

33:31.360 --> 33:32.360
I wanted to transfer

33:32.561 --> 33:33.681
to economics next year.

33:34.841 --> 33:35.921
Today,

33:37.000 --> 33:37.841
your group

33:37.841 --> 33:38.841
surprised me the most.

33:39.360 --> 33:40.441
When everyone

33:41.000 --> 33:42.080
was committed to

33:42.080 --> 33:43.280
industrial upgrading,

33:44.521 --> 33:45.641
yet you relied on

33:45.960 --> 33:47.200
producing basic products

33:47.681 --> 33:48.681
to survive.

33:49.120 --> 33:50.120
Tell me what you thought.

33:51.601 --> 33:53.721
When we were halfway
through the simulation,

33:53.721 --> 33:55.360
we noticed
our deficit was already large.

33:55.681 --> 33:57.000
Since the market

33:57.000 --> 33:58.641
is largely driven by supply and demand,

33:58.881 --> 34:00.481
rather than blindly expanding,

34:00.481 --> 34:01.321
we might take a risk,

34:01.321 --> 34:02.721
focusing on basic products.

34:03.841 --> 34:04.921
The profit is low,

34:05.120 --> 34:06.360
but its market is broad.

34:06.721 --> 34:08.240
Maybe we can make up for the deficit.

34:09.040 --> 34:10.040
Well said.

34:11.761 --> 34:12.400
Please sit.

34:12.400 --> 34:13.400
Thank you, Sir.

34:15.481 --> 34:17.240
Everyone heard that?

34:17.521 --> 34:18.801
Today's assessment

34:19.160 --> 34:20.960
fully illustrates a point.

34:21.641 --> 34:24.481
Theory says

34:25.080 --> 34:28.360
success comes
only through industrial upgrading.

34:28.721 --> 34:30.360
This path is crowded with people,

34:31.080 --> 34:34.521
but there is more than
one path to success in reality.

34:35.000 --> 34:36.641
Just like our lives,

34:39.481 --> 34:41.000
there is not only one

34:41.721 --> 34:42.721
standard answer.

34:54.320 --> 34:55.320
See.

34:55.641 --> 34:57.280
This is a competition.

34:57.481 --> 34:59.801
Moreover, it concerns
the future of Chen Luzhou.

35:00.120 --> 35:01.841
If he gets familiar with Professor Liu,

35:01.960 --> 35:03.801
it'll help him switch majors and get

35:04.080 --> 35:05.080
into grad school.

35:05.441 --> 35:07.240
We should think for him, right?

35:08.521 --> 35:09.522
But...

35:09.522 --> 35:11.000
I appreciate your kindness.

35:11.641 --> 35:13.400
But if it were me, I'd choose Bai Jiang.

35:14.801 --> 35:16.120
I just audited his class.

35:16.441 --> 35:17.960
And I read a few of his papers.

35:18.681 --> 35:19.881
In terms of academic ability,

35:19.881 --> 35:21.561
he's no worse than
those popular mentors.

35:22.681 --> 35:23.721
And somehow,

35:24.280 --> 35:26.641
I feel he suits us better.

35:29.561 --> 35:30.442
Alright.

35:30.442 --> 35:31.761
You get two votes now.

35:32.320 --> 35:33.441
I'll contact Bai Jiang then.

35:35.801 --> 35:36.801
Hold on.

35:37.641 --> 35:39.240
You're from the Computer Science School.

35:39.240 --> 35:40.761
Why do you have his WeChat?

35:41.801 --> 35:42.841
You support him so much.

35:43.040 --> 35:44.441
Is he your relative?

35:46.280 --> 35:48.280
Not yet. I suppose.

35:49.521 --> 35:51.280
What do you mean?

35:54.681 --> 35:55.960
Actually,

35:57.120 --> 35:58.881
he's my girlfriend's dad.

35:59.120 --> 35:59.481
Dad...

36:00.080 --> 36:01.240
Wang Yue, you!

36:01.240 --> 36:01.561
What?

36:01.561 --> 36:02.561
For your own gain?

36:03.000 --> 36:04.921
Luzhou also appreciates him.

36:06.160 --> 36:08.160
At most, it's an accidental success.

36:08.160 --> 36:09.360
Alright, just wait.

36:09.360 --> 36:11.601
When Ke and I go to your wedding,

36:11.921 --> 36:13.400
can we skip giving the wedding money?

36:14.200 --> 36:15.881
You might get married quicker.

36:15.881 --> 36:17.320
Looking at the two of you,

36:17.320 --> 36:18.521
you could get married anytime.

36:19.641 --> 36:20.921
Me and Xu Zhi?

36:20.921 --> 36:21.960
- Yes.
- Who else?

36:22.601 --> 36:23.921
Are we that clingy?

36:25.120 --> 36:26.160
You just realized?

36:28.120 --> 36:29.120
In the passion phase.

36:29.601 --> 36:30.721
Please bear with us.

36:33.160 --> 36:34.601
Tolerate it for a moment of calm.

36:35.120 --> 36:36.960
Step back and I'll get angry.

36:37.561 --> 36:38.561
Attack!

36:42.721 --> 36:43.442
Come on.

36:43.442 --> 36:45.960
Time to celebrate Cai Yingying
wrapping up her art exam.

36:45.960 --> 36:46.721
- Cheers!
- Cheers!

36:46.721 --> 36:47.721
Congratulations!

36:49.921 --> 36:51.641
As long as you can
get last year's score,

36:51.641 --> 36:52.681
you're set for first-tier.

36:52.681 --> 36:54.641
Don't worry.
I'll study hard when I go back.

36:54.641 --> 36:57.280
I'll study as hard as I can.

36:58.441 --> 36:59.441
When are you going back?

36:59.841 --> 37:00.841
Tomorrow.

37:02.721 --> 37:03.721
So soon?

37:04.801 --> 37:06.921
Zhi, I'm going to miss you.

37:07.160 --> 37:09.080
It's only for a few days, right?

37:09.240 --> 37:10.441
It's winter vacation soon,

37:10.441 --> 37:11.400
and we'll be going back.

37:11.400 --> 37:12.400
Alright.

37:12.681 --> 37:13.681
By the way,

37:14.240 --> 37:15.921
the date for the competition is set.

37:16.200 --> 37:17.280
I won't go back.

37:26.080 --> 37:26.521
No problem.

37:26.761 --> 37:27.960
It's only for a few days.

37:30.400 --> 37:31.400
Zhi.

37:31.481 --> 37:32.921
We need to move forward.

37:34.400 --> 37:37.160
Chen Luzhou, you've got some nerve.

37:38.320 --> 37:39.601
What are you two doing?

37:39.601 --> 37:40.960
I'm the boss today.

37:40.960 --> 37:41.522
Let's drink.

37:41.522 --> 37:42.960
- Come on. Keep drinking.
- Cheers.

37:43.400 --> 37:44.481
Cheers!

37:56.280 --> 37:57.481
Cai Yingying,

37:57.761 --> 37:59.921
I have to go prepare for my competition.

38:00.921 --> 38:01.681
See you then, okay?

38:01.681 --> 38:02.080
Alright.

38:02.320 --> 38:03.641
Zhi, let's leave.

38:07.360 --> 38:08.761
Zhi will leave with you?

38:09.080 --> 38:10.080
She needs to go with me.

38:11.641 --> 38:13.240
Okay, no problem. You guys go.

38:13.521 --> 38:14.681
I'll accompany her.

38:14.761 --> 38:15.000
Okay.

38:15.000 --> 38:15.360
Bye-bye.

38:15.881 --> 38:16.881
See you.

38:22.881 --> 38:24.881
Thank you, Stylish Zhu.

38:27.761 --> 38:28.881
For what?

38:30.721 --> 38:34.641
Thank you
for discovering a beautiful host.

38:39.160 --> 38:40.160
Beautiful host.

38:43.000 --> 38:44.040
I'll take you somewhere.

38:46.681 --> 38:48.120
Why being mysterious?

38:49.080 --> 38:50.200
You'll know it.

38:51.521 --> 38:52.521
Alright.

38:52.960 --> 38:54.080
Close your eyes. Don't peek.

38:54.721 --> 38:55.721
Go up two more steps.

38:55.881 --> 38:56.562
Are we there?

38:56.562 --> 38:58.000
Two steps.

38:58.000 --> 38:59.561
Why being mysterious?

38:59.801 --> 39:00.641
Move forward.

39:00.641 --> 39:01.240
What is it?

39:01.240 --> 39:02.201
Not yet. Move forward.

39:02.201 --> 39:03.320
Anything here?

39:03.320 --> 39:04.561
No, you'll know soon.

39:04.921 --> 39:05.521
Turn right.

39:05.761 --> 39:06.761
Turn right.

39:06.881 --> 39:07.801
Five more steps.

39:07.881 --> 39:10.481
- One, two, three, four, turn right.
- One, two, three, four.

39:11.120 --> 39:12.120
Alright.

39:14.104 --> 39:17.320
♪We are not afraid of
the complicated world♪

39:17.320 --> 39:18.320
How is it?

39:18.681 --> 39:21.000
Zhu Yangqi's personal art exhibition?

39:21.481 --> 39:22.521
You painted all these?

39:22.521 --> 39:23.521
Of course.

39:23.761 --> 39:24.761
Look, who is that?

39:25.400 --> 39:26.801
That? That is me.

39:27.721 --> 39:28.161
No way.

39:28.161 --> 39:30.681
These legs need
to be 10 centimeters longer.

39:30.681 --> 39:32.200
And make this waist slimmer.

39:32.441 --> 39:33.321
Make the eyes bigger.

39:33.321 --> 39:34.481
And make the head smaller.

39:35.240 --> 39:36.121
No, no.

39:36.121 --> 39:38.200
I'm a painter, not a retoucher.

39:38.200 --> 39:39.200
Okay?

39:39.681 --> 39:41.561
Okay, Mr. Zhu, the great painter.

39:41.561 --> 39:42.280
Name your price.

39:42.280 --> 39:43.280
I'll buy this painting.

39:44.000 --> 39:45.000
Okay.

39:45.160 --> 39:46.160
Madam.

39:46.561 --> 39:48.481
As a friend,
I'll give you a big discount.

39:48.641 --> 39:49.641
One million.

39:49.801 --> 39:51.120
What?

39:51.801 --> 39:53.921
Officer, someone's extorting here.

39:55.681 --> 39:56.921
What? Where?

40:00.792 --> 40:05.484
♪You are like an umbrella,
always catching the raindrops♪

40:05.484 --> 40:09.213
♪We are not afraid of
the complicated world♪

40:09.213 --> 40:12.742
♪Only passionate love
like a ray of sunshine♪

40:13.240 --> 40:15.449
♪Can beat the night♪

40:15.544 --> 40:19.289
♪We can outrun time♪

40:19.608 --> 40:23.386
♪Let beautiful stories and wishes♪

40:23.512 --> 40:27.460
♪All blend into our season♪

40:27.460 --> 40:31.154
♪No matter how the future changes♪

40:31.154 --> 40:35.330
♪No matter how far, I'll be with you♪

40:37.752 --> 40:41.026
♪Every moment's like
a firework's display♪

40:41.208 --> 40:45.809
♪We'll have more summers,
bright and gay♪

40:46.168 --> 40:49.120
♪We will touch this world together♪

40:49.120 --> 40:50.120
(Zhu Yangqi)
(Have you arrived at Qingyi?)

40:50.360 --> 40:51.361
(Text me)

40:51.361 --> 40:52.681
(when you're home.)

40:54.168 --> 40:56.383
♪Turn into a scorching summer♪

40:56.383 --> 40:58.761
♪We'll turn our backs
on youth together and take risks♪

40:58.761 --> 40:59.761
(Text.)

41:00.792 --> 41:03.914
♪Let all the sadness and joy♪

41:04.312 --> 41:08.841
♪All blend into our season♪

41:14.744 --> 41:17.336
♪We'll always be fiercely alive♪

41:24.696 --> 41:30.733
♪Promise me, you will never go far♪

41:41.681 --> 41:42.681
What to do?

41:43.000 --> 41:44.841
I've started missing you.

41:45.761 --> 41:46.761
Stop it.

41:46.881 --> 41:47.842
You said you missed me,

41:47.842 --> 41:49.521
but you got a full score in Calculus.

41:50.040 --> 41:51.681
I don't believe your words.

41:51.921 --> 41:53.481
It's up to you.

41:56.881 --> 41:58.320
Remember to text me.

41:59.921 --> 42:01.320
Let me give you a hug.

42:05.120 --> 42:06.120
Alright.

42:07.441 --> 42:10.080
You better tell me everything.

42:10.280 --> 42:10.882
Sure.

42:10.882 --> 42:13.280
So I'd know
if you faint in the bathroom.

42:15.400 --> 42:16.000
Bye-bye.

42:16.160 --> 42:16.921
Take care.

42:17.120 --> 42:18.120
Okay.

42:49.040 --> 42:50.040
Let's go.

42:52.280 --> 42:53.721
I told you to keep warm.

42:53.721 --> 42:54.960
Look, your legs are bare.

42:54.960 --> 42:55.960
Are you feeling cold?

42:56.481 --> 42:57.040
Give it to me.

42:57.120 --> 42:58.160
I'll do it.

42:58.761 --> 43:00.280
This new car is pretty.

43:01.481 --> 43:02.160
It has promotion.

43:02.481 --> 43:03.482
So I sold the old car

43:03.482 --> 43:04.960
and added a bit of money

43:04.960 --> 43:06.280
to get this new car.

43:06.481 --> 43:07.681
You should've listened to me.

43:07.681 --> 43:09.080
Keeping money means nothing.

43:09.080 --> 43:10.801
Okay, I'll listen to you from now on.

43:11.641 --> 43:12.641
I'm the listening type.

43:15.320 --> 43:16.320
(Shy Boy Chen,)

43:16.561 --> 43:18.761
(I've realized
that I especially love you in Beijing.)

43:19.561 --> 43:20.561
(Shy Boy Chen)
(Missed me already?)

43:22.441 --> 43:23.441
(Luckily.)

43:23.561 --> 43:24.960
(Once back in Qingyi,)

43:24.960 --> 43:26.000
(I miss you less.)

43:26.360 --> 43:27.561
(Do well in your competition.)

43:27.561 --> 43:28.601
(Good luck!)

43:28.601 --> 43:29.801
(I'll go enjoy my vacation.)

43:35.921 --> 43:36.921
- Xu.
- What did you do?

43:39.240 --> 43:40.601
What are we eating?

44:14.200 --> 44:15.395
(Raining cats and dogs,)

44:15.395 --> 44:20.846
(she said she would always love me.)

44:23.145 --> 44:28.961
♪Like a cloud drifting away♪

44:29.513 --> 44:35.041
♪Freely crossing the vast sky♪

44:36.553 --> 44:41.001
♪The world is too quiet♪

44:41.993 --> 44:48.921
♪Amplifying all the sounds♪

44:49.833 --> 44:54.921
♪Who will visit me♪

44:55.977 --> 45:01.601
♪Treading carefully
into my personal space♪

45:02.345 --> 45:05.401
♪Turning the frozen loneliness♪

45:05.641 --> 45:10.961
♪Into concern and care♪

45:16.489 --> 45:21.601
♪Watching stars rise and fall♪

45:22.121 --> 45:27.961
♪Gently pushing me to tour your world♪

45:29.417 --> 45:32.801
♪Swirling into a vortex♪

45:32.937 --> 45:39.161
♪You are the whirlwind
changing the course of our future♪

45:39.657 --> 45:42.601
♪The lonely clock♪

45:42.761 --> 45:47.361
♪A relentless pursuit, day and night♪

45:47.753 --> 45:51.001
♪Are we both♪

45:51.273 --> 45:54.801
♪Attracted to each other♪

45:55.945 --> 46:02.561
♪Falling into you♪

46:06.281 --> 46:12.081
♪You are the whirlwind
changing the course of our future♪

46:12.937 --> 46:15.601
♪Just a few more embraces away♪

46:16.137 --> 46:20.761
♪From reaching eternity♪

46:21.161 --> 46:24.441
♪After rushing recklessly♪

46:24.649 --> 46:28.081
♪We approach each other♪

46:29.353 --> 46:32.961
♪Without turning back♪

46:34.345 --> 46:42.001
♪In your eyes, I see myself♪

46:42.633 --> 46:49.121
♪Falling into you♪
